<section class="about-section about-gears" data-module="5" aria-labelledby="about-heading-5">
<div class="about-container">
<span class="about-kicker">THE BOTANICAL MECHANISM</span>
<h2 id="about-heading-5">THE AMOUNT CHANGES THE EXPERIENCE.</h2>
<p>People report both stimulating and sedating effects from kratom. The amount is one factor; the product and your own response matter too. A milligram figure describes the contents, not a guaranteed feeling.</p>
<div class="about-gear-grid">
<article class="about-gear about-card">
<div class="about-gear-badge">GEAR <span class="about-gear-number">01</span> · LOWER AMOUNT</div>
<h3>ENERGY &amp; ALERTNESS</h3>
<p class="about-dose">Compare the labeled strength per gummy or capsule.</p>
<p>Reports of lower amounts include increased energy and alertness. Kratom and caffeine act differently in the body. Rapid heart rate is a reported side effect.</p>
</article>
<article class="about-gear about-card">
<div class="about-gear-badge">GEAR <span class="about-gear-number">02</span> · HIGHER AMOUNT</div>
<h3>RELAXATION &amp; SEDATION</h3>
<p class="about-dose">Higher strength does not guarantee a better experience.</p>
<p>People also report relaxation and sedating effects. Drowsiness and confusion are possible, and the amount that produces an effect varies. A 90 mg capsule contains more mitragynine than a 35 mg gummy; they are not interchangeable serving recommendations.</p>
</article>
</div>
<p class="about-mechanism-source"><a href="https://www.nccih.nih.gov/health/kratom" target="_blank" rel="noopener">READ THE NIH OVERVIEW OF KRATOM ↗</a></p>
</div>
</section>
