<span class="about-kicker">THE STORY BEHIND THE MASK</span>
<h2 id="about-heading-7">WHY IS THERE A RACCOON ON EVERYTHING?</h2>
<p>When we designed Dandy, brand consultants suggested we use a sterile pharmaceutical cross or a minimalist silhouette of someone meditating on a mountaintop.</p>
<p>We passed. It felt like corporate dress-up.</p>
<p>Instead, we chose <strong>Rocky the Raccoon</strong>.</p>
<p>Rocky is resourceful, sharp-eyed, and has exceptionally high standards for what he puts in his paws. More importantly, he has zero patience for nonsense, spin, or pretension.</p>
<p>Rocky inspects IDs at our 21+ age gate, rides on the side of our delivery trucks, and flexes on every pouch.</p>
<blockquote class="about-rocky-quote">Rocky’s rule: check the label, then open the batch report.</blockquote>
