<section class="about-section about-limits" data-module="8" aria-labelledby="about-heading-8">
<div class="about-container">
<div class="about-limits-head">
<div>
<span class="about-kicker">RESPONSIBLE BOTANICALS</span>
<h2 id="about-heading-8">WE’LL TELL YOU WHEN NOT TO BUY.</h2>
<p>Honest brands know their boundaries. We love what kratom does, but it is not for everyone, and we refuse to sell it like candy.</p>
</div>
</div>
<ul class="about-rules">
<li class="about-rule about-rule-adults">
<div class="about-rule-heading">
<span class="about-rule-number" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
<h3>Adults 21+ Only</h3>
<img class="" src="https://foreverdandy.com/cdn/shop/t/7/assets/dandy2-rocky-bouncer.webp?v=138005651342958774681788315728" alt="Rocky the Raccoon checking adult identification" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="560" height="560">
</div>
<p>Rocky checks IDs at the door. Kratom is an adult botanical intended solely for mature wellness routines.</p>
</li>
<li class="about-rule">
<div class="about-rule-heading">
<span class="about-rule-number" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
<h3>Respecting State &amp; Local Laws</h3>
</div>
<p>We strictly comply with state and municipal regulations. We cannot and do not ship to Alabama, Arkansas, Indiana, Massachusetts, Rhode Island, Vermont, Wisconsin, or restricted counties/cities. Check before you order.</p>
</li>
<li class="about-rule">
<div class="about-rule-heading">
<span class="about-rule-number" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
<h3>Start Low &amp; Respect the Plant</h3>
</div>
<p>Read the label before you choose a strength. Follow the product directions; do not assume a capsule and a gummy contain the same amount.</p>
</li>
<li class="about-rule">
<div class="about-rule-heading">
<span class="about-rule-number" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
<h3>Do Not Mix</h3>
</div>
<p>Never combine kratom with alcohol, prescription sedatives, or other central nervous system depressants.</p>
</li>
<li class="about-rule about-rule-days-off">
<div class="about-rule-heading">
<span class="about-rule-number" aria-hidden="true">5</span>
<h3>Schedule Days Off</h3>
</div>
<p>Regular use can lead to tolerance and dependence. Days off do not eliminate those risks.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
